   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/uber/mag.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "You can wrap temporal threads around you, assuming the form of a telugoroth for 10 turns.\n\t\tWhile in this form you gain pinning, bleeding, blindness and stun immunity, 30%% temporal resistance, your temporal damage bonus is set to your current highest damage bonus + 30%%, 50%% of the damage you deal becomes temporal, and you gain 20%% temporal resistance penetration.\n\t\tYou also are able to cast anomalies: Anomaly Rearrange, Anomaly Temporal Storm, Anomaly Flawed Design, Anomaly Gravity Pull and Anomaly Wormhole.",
   "target": "你可以扭曲周围的时间线，转换成时空元素“泰鲁格罗斯”形态，持续 10 回合。\n\t\t在这种形态中，你对定身、流血、致盲、震慑免疫，获得 30%% 时空抗性和 20%% 的时空抗性穿透。\n\t\t你造成的伤害的 50%% 转化为时空伤害。\n\t\t同时，你的时空伤害增益等于你所有类型的伤害增益中的最大值，此外，还增加 30%% 额外时空伤害增益。\n\t\t你在时空形态下能释放以下异常：异常：重排，异常：时空风暴，异常：不完美设计，异常：重力牵引和异常：虫洞。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/uber/mag.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
